m(2,"Correlates","Which of these correlates with the beginning of civil resistance campaigns?","A large population",["A long history of armed conflict","A military regime","Low levels of education"],"A large population makes campaigns more likely in any given year (as in China, India, the US and Russia). Recent armed conflict and the type of autocracy do not seem to matter systematically.",1);
